 Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, and August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 32 of them. In 2025, August to September fell to 64% of normal on the middle of the grids, the low pair that year. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 62% and June to July at 128% on the middle of the grids. Grid 21494 had its driest year in 1960 at 73% of normal.</p>"}
